      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: ₹1.17 loss per share (vs ₹1.23 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹1.17 loss per share (improved from ₹1.23 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹20.1b (up 4.5% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹1.61b (loss narrowed 5.2% from 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 39% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 4% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
